   "That a recorded human approval was wise, legally sufficient, or made by the correct organizational authority.",
   "That Sparta Explorer is production-ready, certified, accredited, secure, or a turnkey deployment.",
   "That cold authoring works without approved source imagery; the required behavior is refusal."
  ]
 },
